        </div>

        <hr class="border-secondary mt-4" />

        <p class="text-center mb-0 opacity-75">© 2025 - Nguyễn Tiến Dũng | Xây dựng websites bán sản phẩm công nghệ Apple</p>
        <p class="text-center mb-0 opacity-75">
            <i clas="bi bi-github"></i>
            <a class="text-center mb-0" href="https://github.com/dungnt0312003-tvu2024/ASPNET-dk24ttc2-nguyentiendung-websitebansanphamAPPLE">https://github.com/dungnt0312003-tvu2024/ASPNET-dk24ttc2-nguyentiendung-websitebansanphamAPPLE</a>
        </p>
    </div>
</footer>
</body>
</html>
